  offerText: Purchase this heavy, rusted lockbox. I have no idea what is inside,
    but it requires significant space and costs a fair bit of coin.
  acceptResultText: You buy the heavy box and pry it open. It is completely empty!
    You feel deeply foolish and depressed for buying literal junk.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to buy unverified junk. Your wallet stays heavy, and
    your floor stays perfectly clear.
  acceptedDelayedText: While moving the empty lockbox, you notice a false bottom!
